-- 14.5% is 26.505), to the half-shekel the circular prints.
#ASSERT (`the cost of a daily free pass` (Date 1 1 2016) TIMES (1 MINUS `the reform's tariff cut`)) MINUS `the cost of a daily free pass` `the tariff cut takes effect` LESS THAN 0.01

`a Tel Aviv commuter who moved home near Jerusalem` MEANS
    `traveller` WITH
        `day hired by the current employer`                         IS Date 1 9 2010
        `received the urban monthly free pass up to 31.12.2015`     IS TRUE
        `received an individual intercity allowance up to 31.12.2015` IS TRUE
        `lives in Modiin or Beit Shemesh and works in Jerusalem`    IS FALSE
        `moved workplace within the employer or moved home`         IS TRUE
        `travels between cities to work`                            IS FALSE
        `moved from another employer`                               IS FALSE
        `days actually worked in the month`                         IS 20

#ASSERT `the travel-allowance rule` `a Tel Aviv commuter who moved home near Jerusalem` EQUALS `no intercity travel paid`

`an official trip outside the city without a car entitlement` MEANS
    `official trip` WITH
        `the employee has a service car and is past the kilometre quota` IS FALSE
        `the employee has no car entitlement`                            IS TRUE
        `outside the city`                                               IS TRUE
#ASSERT `an official trip paid at single-trip tariffs` `an official trip outside the city without a car entitlement`

